{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. Check properties and perform specific task. Move randomly if no object visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    />\"",
